msgid "Select the person whose story to generate, then try again."
msgstr "ストーリーを生成する人物を選択してから、もう一度試してください。"

msgid "Couldn't generate the story"
msgstr "ストーリーを生成できませんでした"

msgid "Story saved"
msgstr "ストーリーを保存しました"

#, python-format
msgid ""
"%(count)d slides saved to %(path)s.\n"
"\n"
"Open it in the Gramps Connect Story Viewer: https://dsblank.github.io/gramps-"
"connect-stories/"
msgstr ""
"%(count)d 枚のスライドを %(path)s に保存しました。\n"
"\n"
"Gramps Connect Story Viewer で開く: https://dsblank.github.io/gramps-connect-"
"stories/"

msgid "_Open in Browser"
msgstr "ブラウザで開く(_O)"

msgid "Story"
msgstr "ストーリー"

msgid "Generate Story"
msgstr "ストーリーを生成"

msgid "Generate the story of:"
msgstr "ストーリーを生成する対象："

#, python-format
msgid "Family: %s"
msgstr "家族：%s"

msgid "Include families"
msgstr "家族を含める"

msgid ""
"Also draw on this person's own families: a spouse's and children's births "
"and deaths, and their parents' and siblings'."
msgstr ""
"この人物自身の家族からも取り込みます：配偶者と子どもの出生・死亡、およびその"
"両親と兄弟姉妹の情報です。"

msgid "Include each person's own birth and death in this family's story:"
msgstr "この家族のストーリーに各人物自身の出生と死亡を含める："

msgid "Include living people (and photos they appear in)"
msgstr "存命の人物を含める（およびその人物が写っている写真）"

msgid "Stories (*.story.zip)"
msgstr "ストーリー (*.story.zip)"

msgid ""
"This family is marked private. To generate its story, check \"Include data "
"marked private\"."
msgstr ""
"この家族は非公開に設定されています。ストーリーを生成するには、「非公開データ"
"を含める」をオンにしてください。"

#, python-format
msgid ""
"%s is marked private. To generate their story, check \"Include data marked "
"private\"."
msgstr ""
"%s は非公開に設定されています。ストーリーを生成するには、「非公開データを含め"
"る」をオンにしてください。"

#, python-format
msgid ""
"%s is probably living. To generate their story, check \"Include living "
"people\"."
msgstr ""
"%s はおそらく存命です。ストーリーを生成するには、「存命の人物を含める」をオン"
"にしてください。"

#, python-format
msgid "%(who)s was born"
msgstr "%(who)s が誕生しました"

#, python-format
msgid "%(who)s was stillborn"
msgstr "%(who)s は死産でした"

#, python-format
msgid "%(who)s was baptized"
msgstr "%(who)s は洗礼を受けました"

#, python-format
msgid "%(who)s was christened"
msgstr "%(who)s は洗礼命名を受けました"

#, python-format
msgid "%(who)s was blessed"
msgstr "%(who)s は祝福を受けました"

#, python-format
msgid "%(who)s was confirmed"
msgstr "%(who)s は堅信を受けました"

#, python-format
msgid "%(who)s took First Communion"
msgstr "%(who)s は初聖体を受けました"

#, python-format
msgid "%(who)s celebrated their Bar Mitzvah"
msgstr "%(who)s はバル・ミツワーを行いました"

#, python-format
msgid "%(who)s celebrated their Bas Mitzvah"
msgstr "%(who)s はバト・ミツワーを行いました"

#, python-format
msgid "%(who)s was adopted"
msgstr "%(who)s は養子縁組しました"

#, python-format
msgid "%(who)s graduated"
msgstr "%(who)s は卒業しました"

#, python-format
msgid "%(who)s was awarded a degree"
msgstr "\"%(who)s は学位を取得しました"

#, python-format
msgid "%(who)s emigrated"
msgstr "%(who)s は移住（出国）しました"

#, python-format
msgid "%(who)s immigrated"
msgstr "%(who)s は移住（入国）しました"

#, python-format
msgid "%(who)s was naturalized"
msgstr "%(who)s は帰化しました"

#, python-format
msgid "%(who)s was ordained"
msgstr "%(who)s は聖職に叙任されました"

#, python-format
msgid "%(who)s was elected"
msgstr "%(who)s は選出されました"

#, python-format
msgid "%(who)s retired"
msgstr "%(who)s は退職しました"

#, python-format
msgid "%(who)s died"
msgstr "%(who)s が死去しました"

#, python-format
msgid "%(who)s was buried"
msgstr "%(who)s は埋葬されました"

#, python-format
msgid "%(who)s was cremated"
msgstr "%(who)s は火葬されました"

#, python-format
msgid "%(who)s had their estate probated"
msgstr "%(who)s の遺産が検認されました"

#, python-format
msgid "%(who)s were married"
msgstr "%(who)s は結婚しました"

#, python-format
msgid "%(who)s had their banns read"
msgstr "%(who)s の婚姻予告が読み上げられました"

#, python-format
msgid "%(who)s signed a marriage contract"
msgstr "%(who)s は婚姻契約を結びました"

#, python-format
msgid "%(who)s took out a marriage license"
msgstr "%(who)s は結婚許可証を取得しました"

#, python-format
msgid "%(who)s agreed a marriage settlement"
msgstr "%(who)s は婚姻財産契約に合意しました"

#, python-format
msgid "%(who)s were engaged"
msgstr "%(who)s は婚約しました"

#, python-format
msgid "%(who)s were divorced"
msgstr "%(who)s は離婚しました"

#, python-format
msgid "%(who)s filed for divorce"
msgstr "%(who)s は離婚を申請しました"

#, python-format
msgid "%(who)s had their marriage annulled"
msgstr "%(who)s の婚姻は無効とされました"

#, python-format
msgid "%(who)s were recorded in the census"
msgstr "%(who)s は国勢調査に記録されました"

#, python-format
msgid "%(who)s lived"
msgstr "%(who)s は住んでいました"

#, python-format
msgid "%(names)s and %(last)s"
msgstr "%(names)s と %(last)s"

#, python-format
msgid "%(type)s (%(role)s)"
msgstr "%(type)s（%(role)s）"

#, python-format
msgid "%(type)s of %(who)s"
msgstr "%(who)s の %(type)s"

#, python-format
msgid "%(who)s took part in this %(type)s as %(role)s"
msgstr "%(who)s は %(role)s としてこの %(type)s に参加しました"

#, python-format
msgid "%(moment)s on %(date)s"
msgstr "%(date)s の %(moment)s"

#, python-format
msgid "%(moment)s in %(date)s"
msgstr "%(date)s における %(moment)s"

#, python-format
msgid "%(moment)s %(date)s"
msgstr "%(moment)s（%(date)s）"

#, python-format
msgid "%(moment)s in %(place)s"
msgstr "%(place)s での %(moment)s"

#, python-format
msgid "%d moment"
msgid_plural "%d moments"
msgstr[0] "%d つの場面"
msgstr[1] "%d つの場面"

msgid "This person isn't included with the chosen privacy settings."
msgstr "この人物は、選択されたプライバシー設定では含まれません。"

#, python-format
msgid "%s has no events to build a story from."
msgstr "%s にはストーリーを組み立てるための出来事がありません。"

#, python-format
msgid "The Story of %s"
msgstr "%s のストーリー"

#, python-format
msgid "%(moments)s from %(name)s's recorded life."
msgstr "%(name)s の記録された人生からの %(moments)s。"

msgid "This family isn't included with the chosen privacy settings."
msgstr "この家族は、選択されたプライバシー設定では含まれません。"

msgid "this family"
msgstr "この家族"

msgid ""
"This family has no events to build a story from: not on the family itself, "
"and no births or deaths recorded for its members."
msgstr ""
"この家族にはストーリーを組み立てるための出来事がありません：家族自体に出来事"
"がなく、構成員の出生・死亡も記録されていません。"

#, python-format
msgid "%(moments)s from the life of %(couple)s and %(children)s."
msgstr "%(couple)s と %(children)s の人生からの %(moments)s。"

#, python-format
msgid "their child"
msgid_plural "their %(count)d children"
msgstr[0] "その子ども"
msgstr[1] "その %(count)d 子ども"

#, python-format
msgid "%(moments)s from the life of %(couple)s."
msgstr "%(couple)s の人生からの %(moments)s。"

#, python-format
msgid "Family %s"
msgstr "家族 %s"

msgid ""
"Generates the story of a person or a family (.story.zip): a slideshow of "
"their events with dates, places and photos, for the Gramps Connect Story "
"Viewer"
msgstr ""
"人物または家族のストーリー（.story.zip）を生成します。出来事を日付・場所・写"
"真とともにスライドショーにしたもので、Gramps Connect Story Viewer で表示でき"
"ます"
